Z||000009||Rodrv6||07-10-2001||03:50 PM||||I don't have a clue about what the rings are for.  Anyone else know?<P>------------------<BR>Rod Schneider, Woodstock, Ga.  84 SE, 330,000 miles and counting, 88 GT, not nearly as many miles :)||||reg||1
